7th ascension, 6th female, 2nd neutral, 3rd genoless.

Third time's the charm. My first promising healer met Arch Lich on
dungeon level 9, second one was killed by Cyclops and now third one
ascended.

First I went to gnome town (co-aligned altar) without killing almost
anything, found cloak of MR, +5 darwish iron helm, +1 iron shoes and
+1 darwish mithril coat on the way and bought some protection. AC -17.
Nice! On the way back to main dungeon I found blessed magic lamp. "You
disturbed me, fool!" Djinni ate some dagger.

Then sokoban. I lost my pet cat in last level and I still hadn't an
unicorn horn, so I decided not finish sokoban yet. I continued in main
dungeon  and after few levels I finally got an unicorn horn and
wielded it. Then I went to get BoH in soko, luckstone in mines.

In main dungeon I found a huge ring shop, few magic markers and
another magic lamp. I ate tengu and got teleportisis. I killed all
dragons in quest home level, and still got no scales. I had no means
to cross the water so I decided to wish for a wand of polymorph,
bought every ring in shop and polypiled for =oL, PC, TC, C, FA etc. I
killed Medusa with a mirror, and went to the castle. Only gray dragon
left scales, but wand had 3 charges. I wished for +3 speed boots. Now
I got everything I wanted and WoW (0:2).

Quest was easy, until Cyclops. I wore =oC and FA. I got teleported to
center of level. Not good. Conflict kept dragons away from me. Then
Cyclops attacked. Hp dropped from 140 to 63 and two levels was
drained. Then I wielded !oParalysis and hit Cyclops, healed my self,
and then killed paralysed Cyclops easily.

On the castle I enchanted and fooproofed my stuff and wished for
amulet of unchanging. I polymorphed into Arch Lich (nice AC,
non-breathing and sleep resistance, which I didn't have). I used
wishes left for magic markers

The rest was quite boring... (nothing worth of mention) Until plane of
air. Now I really understand why plane of air is say to be hard and
why everyone hates liches. There was an Arch lich on plane of air,
which wasn't really nice. I quaffed half of my potions of FH in plane
of air. Fire and water was quite easy. Astral wasn't.

After my first move, Arch lich and 2 Master liches teleported right
next to me. Then they summoned lots of other monster. It took at least
15 minutes to get to first altar, and thankfully it was neutral one. I
offered the amulet and ascended to status of demigoddess once again.

A, V, Ra (polyless), B (genoless), P, K (polygenoless) and H
(genoless) done, next probably S.

